<title>RUSSIA: Russian Trading System closes lower at 351.40.</title>
<headline>Russian Trading System closes lower at 351.40.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Trading System 22-share index fell to 351.40 on Wednesday from Tuesday's closing 356.30, according to the brokers association NAUFOR.</p>
<p>Total market turnover was $43.0 million, generally considered a healthy level for Russia's emerging market.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
